if (table) {
    for (int c = 0; c < table->GetNumberCols(); ++c) {
        if (table->GetColLabelValue(c) == colLabel) {
            return grid->GetCellValue(row, c);
        }
    }
}
```

3) Performance: map labels → column indices
If you frequently need to look up by label, build a map once and update it when columns/labels change:

