Short answer (expert recommendation)
- Use C++11 <random> with std::mt19937 (Mersenne Twister) and std::uniform_int_distribution<int> dist(0,19). This gives an even distribution without modulo bias and is the standard, practical solution.

Why
- Modulo of rand() can produce bias unless handled with rejection sampling.
- <random> provides high-quality generators and distributions; uniform_int_distribution maps generator output evenly to the requested range.

Recommended code (simple, correct, reproducible when needed)
- Seed once and reuse the generator; seeding each call with std::random_device is unnecessary and can reduce statistical quality.

Example — single-file program:
```
#include <iostream>
#include <random>

int main() {
    // Seed once
    std::random_device rd;                 // non-deterministic seed if available
    std::mt19937 gen(rd());                // mersenne twister engine seeded
    std::uniform_int_distribution<int> dist(0, 19); // inclusive range

    // Generate one random number in [0,19]
    int r = dist(gen);
    std::cout << r << '\n';
    return 0;
}
```
Compile:
- g++ -std=c++11 -O2 random19.cpp -o random19

Notes, variations and practical considerations
- Reproducibility: if you need repeatable sequences (for tests), seed with a fixed value: std::mt19937 gen(12345);
- Performance / thread-safety: for multithreaded apps use thread_local engines:
  std::thread_local std::mt19937 gen(seed);
- Cryptographic randomness: std::mt19937 is not cryptographically secure. For cryptographic use, use platform crypto APIs (e.g., /dev/urandom, Windows CNG, libsodium) and map to 0..19 safely (rejection sampling).
- If you must use C's rand(): avoid (value % 20) due to bias. Use rejection sampling with RAND_MAX to avoid bias — but <random> is preferred.

Optional: rand() + rejection sampling (not recommended unless constrained):
```
#include <cstdlib>
#include <ctime>
#include <iostream>

int rand20() {
    const int range = 20;
    const int buckets = RAND_MAX / range;    // full buckets
    const int limit = buckets * range;
    int r;
    do {
        r = rand();
    } while (r >= limit);
    return r % range;
}

int main() {
    srand((unsigned)time(nullptr));
    std::cout << rand20() << '\n';
}
```

How to verify uniformity quickly
- Run many samples (e.g., 1e6) and print counts per value; expect roughly equal counts ± statistical noise.

Conclusion (actionable)
- Use <random> with std::mt19937 + std::uniform_int_distribution(0,19). Seed once and reuse the generator. If you require cryptographic strength, use OS crypto primitives and rejection sampling to map to 0–19.

下面给出一个清晰、可运行且实用的 Java 示例，展示了一个包含多个对象（多个实例与对象成员）、多种方法（业务方法、访问器等）和多个构造函数（重载构造器）的类设计。场景：一个简单的订单系统，包含 Product、Customer、Order 三个类，Order 中包含多个 Product（集合），并提供多种构造函数与业务方法（添加商品、计算总价、打折等）。

代码（保存为 Main.java 后编译运行）：

```java
import java.util.ArrayList;
import java.util.List;
import java.util.Optional;

class Product {
    private final String id;
    private String name;
    private double price;

    // 无参构造
    public Product() {
        this("unknown", "Unnamed", 0.0);
    }

    // 全参构造
    public Product(String id, String name, double price) {
        if (price < 0) throw new IllegalArgumentException("Price cannot be negative.");
        this.id = id;
        this.name = name;
        this.price = price;
    }

    // getter / setter
    public String getId() { return id; }
    public String getName() { return name; }
    public void setName(String name) { this.name = name; }
    public double getPrice() { return price; }
    public void setPrice(double price) {
        if (price < 0) throw new IllegalArgumentException("Price cannot be negative.");
        this.price = price;
    }

    @Override
    public String toString() {
        return String.format("%s (%s): $%.2f", name, id, price);
    }
}

class Customer {
    private final String id;
    private String name;
    private String email;

    public Customer() {
        this("CUST-UNKNOWN", "Unknown", "unknown@example.com");
    }

    public Customer(String id, String name, String email) {
        this.id = id;
        this.name = name;
        this.email = email;
    }

    public String getId() { return id; }
    public String getName() { return name; }
    public String getEmail() { return email; }
    public void setName(String name) { this.name = name; }
    public void setEmail(String email) { this.email = email; }

    @Override
    public String toString() {
        return String.format("%s (%s) <%s>", name, id, email);
    }
}

class Order {
    private final String id;
    private final Customer customer;
    private final List<Product> products;
    private double discountPercent; // 0..100

    // 无参构造（示例，使用默认客户）
    public Order() {
        this("ORDER-UNKNOWN", new Customer(), new ArrayList<>());
    }

    // 构造：指定客户
    public Order(String id, Customer customer) {
        this(id, customer, new ArrayList<>());
    }

    // 全参构造
    public Order(String id, Customer customer, List<Product> products) {
        this.id = id;
        this.customer = customer;
        this.products = new ArrayList<>(products); // 防止外部修改原集合
        this.discountPercent = 0.0;
    }

    // 添加商品
    public void addProduct(Product p) {
        if (p == null) throw new IllegalArgumentException("Product cannot be null.");
        products.add(p);
    }

    // 根据 productId 删除商品（仅示例）
    public boolean removeProductById(String productId) {
        Optional<Product> found = products.stream()
                .filter(p -> p.getId().equals(productId))
                .findFirst();
        if (found.isPresent()) {
            products.remove(found.get());
            return true;
        }
        return false;
    }

    // 计算总价（应用折扣前）
    public double calculateSubtotal() {
        return products.stream().mapToDouble(Product::getPrice).sum();
    }

    // 应用折扣（例如 10 表示 10%）
    public void applyDiscountPercent(double percent) {
        if (percent < 0 || percent > 100) throw new IllegalArgumentException("Invalid discount percent.");
        this.discountPercent = percent;
    }

    public double calculateTotal() {
        double subtotal = calculateSubtotal();
        return subtotal * (1 - discountPercent / 100.0);
    }

    public int totalItems() {
        return products.size();
    }

    public String getId() { return id; }
    public Customer getCustomer() { return customer; }

    public void printSummary() {
        System.out.println("Order ID: " + id);
        System.out.println("Customer: " + customer);
        System.out.printf("Items (%d):%n", totalItems());
        products.forEach(p -> System.out.println("  - " + p));
        System.out.printf("Subtotal: $%.2f%n", calculateSubtotal());
        System.out.printf("Discount: %.2f%%%n", discountPercent);
        System.out.printf("Total: $%.2f%n", calculateTotal());
    }
}

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        // 创建多个 Product 对象
        Product p1 = new Product("P001", "Wireless Mouse", 25.99);
        Product p2 = new Product("P002", "Mechanical Keyboard", 88.50);
        Product p3 = new Product("P003", "USB-C Charger", 19.95);

        // 创建多个 Customer 对象（使用不同构造器）
        Customer alice = new Customer("C001", "Alice Zhang", "alice@example.com");
        Customer bob = new Customer(); // 使用默认构造器

        // 创建 Order：使用不同的构造函数
        Order order1 = new Order("O1001", alice); // start with empty product list
        order1.addProduct(p1);
        order1.addProduct(p2);

        Order order2 = new Order("O1002", bob, List.of(p2, p3)); // 全参构造器，传入初始商品集合
        order2.applyDiscountPercent(10); // 给 order2 打 10% 折扣

        // 打印订单摘要
        order1.printSummary();
        System.out.println("----");
        order2.printSummary();

        // 示例：移除商品
        boolean removed = order1.removeProductById("P002");
        System.out.println("Removed P002 from order1? " + removed);
        order1.printSummary();
    }
}
```

说明与设计要点（简要）：
- 多个对象：main 方法中创建了多个 Product、Customer、Order 实例；Order 内部持有多个 Product（List），体现“对象包含对象”的关系。
- 多个构造函数：每个类都演示了无参构造器与带参构造器（构造函数重载），Order 有多种构造选项（空、指定客户、全部传入）。
- 多种方法：包含访问器（getter/setter）、业务方法（addProduct、removeProductById、calculateSubtotal、applyDiscountPercent、calculateTotal、printSummary）。
- 面向对象原则：用私有字段与公共方法封装数据；在构造器中做简单校验；Order 在接收外部集合时做了拷贝以防外部修改。
- 可扩展性：可以进一步加上数量（quantity）支持、折扣规则对象化、持久化等。

